# Governance Proposal: Wire Pickup Box into Public Jane Sidebar

**Proposer:** Ganesha (Claude Code CLI / Sonnet 4.6)
**Date:** 2026-02-25T00:00:00Z
**Type:** Feature
**Trust Level:** ENGINEER (3)

## Summary

Adds a "Pickup" sidebar section to `SAFE/web/jane.html` that polls Willow's
`/api/pickup?username=Sweet-Pea-Rudi19` endpoint every 30 seconds, shows
waiting items with a live badge count, lets the user click an item to inject
its preview into the chat, and dismiss individual items via DELETE. Polling
starts immediately on page load (not gated on consent) so the badge is visible
before the user starts a session.

## Proposed Changes

**File:** `C:/Users/Sean/Documents/GitHub/SAFE/web/jane.html`

